        - generic [ref=e60]: Create a reusable private coaching drill.\n          - listitem [ref=e61]:\n            - link \"Upload media Add a private file, then attach it to coaching work.\" [ref=e62] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /app/media#upload-media\n              - strong [ref=e63]: Upload media\n              - generic [ref=e64]: Add a private file, then attach it to coaching work.\n      - region [ref=e65]:\n        - generic [ref=e66]:\n          - generic [ref=e67]:\n            - generic [ref=e68]: Persisted setup\n            - heading \"Your first-value path is complete.\" [level=2] [ref=e69]\n          - generic [ref=e70]: 4 of 4 required steps\n        - list [ref=e71]:\n          - listitem [ref=e72]:\n            - generic [ref=e73]: ✓\n            - generic [ref=e74]:\n              - strong [ref=e75]: Coach identity\n              - generic [ref=e76]: Saved and ready for the golfer view.\n            - link \"Review\" [ref=e77] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /app/settings\n          - listitem [ref=e78]:\n            - generic [ref=e79]: +\n            - generic [ref=e80]:\n              - strong [ref=e81]: Current package\n              - generic [ref=e82]: \"Optional: connect an existing booking or purchase route later.\"\n            - link \"Add optionally\" [ref=e83] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /app/packages\n          - listitem [ref=e84]:\n            - generic [ref=e85]: ✓\n            - generic [ref=e86]:\n              - strong [ref=e87]: First golfer\n              - generic [ref=e88]: A private adult-golfer record is saved.\n            - link \"Review\" [ref=e89] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /app/golfers/new\n          - listitem [ref=e90]:\n            - generic [ref=e91]: ✓\n            - generic [ref=e92]:\n              - strong [ref=e93]: Complete roadmap\n              - generic [ref=e94]: A three- or four-phase roadmap is ready for review.\n            - link \"Review\" [ref=e95]