rpretation\n              - textbox \"Interpretation\" [ref=e276]: The golfer reported that the comfortable tempo felt easier to repeat.\n            - generic [ref=e277]:\n              - generic [ref=e278]: Limitation\n              - textbox \"Limitation\" [active] [ref=e279]: Self-report was not independently measured on course.\n            - generic [ref=e280]:\n              - generic [ref=e281]: Evidence maturity\n              - combobox \"Evidence maturity\" [ref=e282]:\n                - option \"Choose one\"\n                - option \"Single observation\"\n                - option \"Early indication\" [selected]\n                - option \"Repeated practice\"\n                - option \"On-course observation\"\n                - option \"Insufficient\"\n            - generic [ref=e283]:\n              - generic [ref=e284]: Next evidence needed (optional)\n              - textbox \"Next evidence needed (optional)\" [ref=e285]\n            - generic [ref=e286]:\n              - generic [ref=e287]: Metric name (optional)\n              - textbox \"Metric name (optional)\" [ref=e288]\n            - generic [ref=e289]:\n              - generic [ref=e290]: Metric value (optional)\n              - spinbutton \"Metric value (optional)\" [ref=e291]\n            - generic [ref=e292]:\n              - generic [ref=e293]: Exact metric unit (optional)\n              - textbox \"Exact metric unit (optional)\" [ref=e294]\n            - generic [ref=e295]:\n              - generic [ref=e296]: Non-numeric value or context (optional)\n              - textbox \"Non-numeric value or context (optional)\" [ref=e297]\n            - generic [ref=e298]:\n              - generic [ref=e299]: Comparison role\n              - combobox \"Comparison role\" [ref=e300]:\n                - option \"Choose one\"\n                - option \"Standalone\" [selected]\n                - option \"Baseline\"\n                - option \"Current\"\n            - generic [ref=e301]:\n             