{"type":"after","callId":"call@601","endTime":299179.663,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [ref=e2]:\n  - link \"Skip to main content\" [ref=e3] [cursor=pointer]:\n    - /url: \"#main-content\"\n  - complementary \"Coach workspace account\" [ref=e4]:\n    - link \"Prairie Three Phase Golf Roadmap home\" [ref=e5] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: /app\n      - generic [ref=e6]: PT\n      - generic [ref=e7]:\n        - strong [ref=e8]: Prairie Three Phase Golf\n        - generic [ref=e9]: Roadmap coach workspace\n    - navigation \"Coach workspace\" [ref=e10]:\n      - link \"Overview\" [ref=e11] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app\n      - link \"Golfers\" [ref=e12] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/golfers\n      - link \"Drill library\" [ref=e13] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/coaching/drills\n      - link \"Roadmap templates\" [ref=e14] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/coaching/roadmaps\n      - link \"Media\" [ref=e15] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/media\n      - link \"Packages\" [ref=e16] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/packages\n      - link \"Plan & billing\" [ref=e17] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/billing\n      - link \"Settings\" [ref=e18] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - /url: /app/settings\n    - generic [ref=e19]:\n      - generic [ref=e20]: CT\n      - generic [ref=e21]:\n        - strong [ref=e22]: Coach Three phases without\n        - generic [ref=e23]: qa.three-phase@example.test\n      - button \"Sign out\" [ref=e25] [cursor=pointer]\n  - main [ref=e26]:\n    - generic [ref=e27]:\n      - generic [ref=e28]:\n        - generic [ref=e29]:\n          - generic [ref=e30]: Rich coaching workspace\n          - heading \"Taylor Three Phase\" [level=1] [ref=e135]\n          - paragraph [ref=e32]: Manage reusable drills, lesson lifecycle, evidence, media, launch-monitor data, reviews, and milestones without leaving this golfer record.\n        - generic [ref=e33]:\n          - link \"Back to golfers\" [ref=e136] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /app/golfers\n          - link \"Media library\" [ref=e137] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /app/media\n      - navigation \"Rich coaching destinations\" [ref=e138]:\n        - generic [ref=e139]:\n          - button \"Practice (0)\" [ref=e140] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Lessons (1)\" [ref=e194] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Evidence (2)\" [ref=e318] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Media (0)\" [ref=e143] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Launch data (0)\" [ref=e144] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Review sources (0)\" [ref=e145] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Milestones (0)\" [ref=e146] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Timeline (3)\" [ref=e319] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e148]: Plan revision 4\n      - status [ref=e196]: Evidence record created and available to lessons and phase reviews.\n      - region [ref=e239]:\n        - generic [ref=e241]:\n          - generic [ref=e242]: Evidence record\n          - heading \"Record what was observed, measured, reported, or captured\" [level=2] [ref=e243]\n          - paragraph [ref=e244]: Evidence stays explicit about its source, limitation, maturity, and whether it represents the golfer’s wider pattern. Media is selected from the ready media library.\n        - generic [ref=e245]:\n          - generic [ref=e246]:\n            - generic [ref=e247]:\n              - generic [ref=e248]: Evidence type\n              - combobox \"Evidence type\" [ref=e249]:\n                - option \"Choose one\"\n                - option \"Coach observation\"\n                - option \"Golfer report\"\n                - option \"Measurement\" [selected]\n                - option \"Outcome count\"\n                - option \"Media\"\n                - option \"Comparison\"\n                - option \"Note\"\n            - generic [ref=e250]:\n              - generic [ref=e251]: Context\n              - combobox \"Context\" [ref=e