etation\n              - textbox \"Interpretation\" [ref=e276]: Current carry is shown beside the baseline without implying causation.\n            - generic [ref=e277]:\n              - generic [ref=e278]: Limitation\n              - textbox \"Limitation\" [ref=e279]: Conditions were synthetic and the two small sets cannot prove durable change.\n            - generic [ref=e280]:\n              - generic [ref=e281]: Evidence maturity\n              - combobox \"Evidence maturity\" [ref=e282]:\n                - option \"Choose one\"\n                - option \"Single observation\"\n                - option \"Early indication\" [selected]\n                - option \"Repeated practice\"\n                - option \"On-course observation\"\n                - option \"Insufficient\"\n            - generic [ref=e283]:\n              - generic [ref=e284]: Next evidence needed (optional)\n              - textbox \"Next evidence needed (optional)\" [ref=e285]\n            - generic [ref=e286]:\n              - generic [ref=e287]: Metric name (optional)\n              - textbox \"Metric name (optional)\" [ref=e288]: Carry distance\n            - generic [ref=e289]:\n              - generic [ref=e290]: Metric value (optional)\n              - spinbutton \"Metric value (optional)\" [ref=e291]: \"146\"\n            - generic [ref=e292]:\n              - generic [ref=e293]: Exact metric unit (optional)\n              - textbox \"Exact metric unit (optional)\" [active] [ref=e294]: yd\n            - generic [ref=e295]:\n              - generic [ref=e296]: Non-numeric value or context (optional)\n              - textbox \"Non-numeric value or context (optional)\" [ref=e297]\n            - generic [ref=e298]:\n              - generic [ref=e299]: Comparison role\n              - combobox \"Comparison role\" [ref=e300]:\n                - option \"Choose one\"\n                - option \"Standalone\"\n                - option \"Baseline\"\n                - option \"Current\" [selected]\n            - generic [ref=e301]:\n              - generic [ref=e302]: Comparison group label (optional)\n              - textbox \"Comparison group label (optional)\" [ref=e303]\n          - generic [ref=e304]:\n            - checkbox \"This record is representative beyond this one observation\" [ref=e305]\n            - text: This record is representative beyond this one observation\n          - button \"Create evidence record\" [ref=e306] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e307]:\n          - heading \"Available evidence\" [level=3] [ref=e308]\n          - list [ref=e312]:\n            - listitem [ref=e335]:\n              - generic [ref=e336]:\n                - strong [ref=e337]: R6 centered-strike count\n                - generic [ref=e338]: outcome count\n              - paragraph [ref=e339]: Four centered strikes were counted in the six-shot task.\n              - generic [ref=e340]: \"Coach-counted representative task · Centered strikes: 4 of 6\"\n            - listitem [ref=e327]:\n              - generic [ref=e328]:\n                - strong [ref=e329]: R6 strike measurement\n                - generic [ref=e330]: measurement\n              - paragraph [ref=e331]: Median carry was recorded without converting the source unit.\n              - generic [ref=e332]: \"Synthetic launch monitor summary · Carry distance: 142.5 yd\"\n            - listitem [ref=e320]:\n              - generic [ref=e321]:\n                - strong [ref=e322]: R6 golfer report\n                - generic [ref=e323]: golfer report\n              - paragraph [ref=e324]: The golfer reported that the comfortable tempo felt easier to repeat.\n              - text: Golfer reflection recorded after the lesson\n            - listitem [ref=e313]:\n              - generic [ref=e314]:\n                - strong [ref=e315]: R6 coach observation\n                - generic [ref=e316]: coach observation\n              - paragraph [ref=e317]: Contact improved when transition tempo stayed comfortable.\n              - text: Coach observation during bounded indoor set"}}
